    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperb 3 bed duplex apartment in showhouse condition throughoutOwn door access from external staircaseWonderful living space with spacious living accommodationLocated at the end of the Cul de sac Over-looking open green area to the frontMuch sought after residential developmentexcellent sized bedroomBalcony off the dining area catching morning and afternoon sunAmple car parking to the front of apartmentGas fired central heating and double-glazed windowsOwn door apartment\n\nWelcome to 112 Castleland Court, Balbriggan, a superb three-bedroom duplex apartment presented in truly showhouse condition throughout.\nThis attractive own-door home is accessed via an external staircase, offering both privacy and a sense of independence rarely found in apartment living.\n\nIdeally positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac within this much sought-after residential development, the property enjoys a pleasant outlook over an open green area to the front, creating a bright and tranquil setting. Inside, the apartment boasts wonderful living space with spacious and well-proportioned accommodation designed for comfortable modern living. The light-filled living and dining area provides an inviting space to relax or entertain, while the balcony off the dining area is perfectly positioned to catch both the morning and afternoon sun.\n\nThe property offers three excellent-sized bedrooms, each thoughtfully laid out to maximise comfort and functionality. Additional benefits include gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows for energy efficiency, and ample car parking available directly to the front of the apartment.\n\nCombining generous living space, a prime cul-de-sac location, and an attractive outlook, No. 112 Castleland Court represents an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a stylish and well-maintained home in a convenient Balbriggan setting. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.81m x 3.60m\nwith tiled flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 4.26m x 3.98m\nwith tiled flooring,built in shelving with storage units and TV & fire.\n\nUtility Room - 1.24m x 1.28m\nwith tiled flooring & plumbed for washing machine & dryer.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 8.4m x 8.06m\nOpen plan living room / KitchenTiled splashback, good range of fitted modern shaker wood presses, drawers & worktops\n\nBedroom One - 3.84m x 3.59m\nwith carpet flooring & built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.32m x 2.53m\nfully tiled with electric shower.\n\nBedroom Two - 2.86m x 2.54m\nwith carpet flooring & built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom Three - 2.92m x 3.91m\nwith carpet flooring .\n\nBathroom - 1.70m x 2.54m\nfully tied with bath.\n\n"
      },
